  "definitions": {
    "current_split": "Exclusive priority: own recorded page retry, no live prefill, any positive same-P native Store GET, exactly one live prefill, two or more live prefills. No live prefill intervals include pre-admission observations. Store GET is not necessarily cross-host.",
